erticalPosition). The range is [-660,660]. When the control stick moves vertically to extreme left, the value of verticalPosition is -660. When the control stick moves vertically to extreme right, the value of verticalPosition is 660.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>position</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> </code></span></td><td>The movement amount of the stick in vertical direction.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_getverticalposition\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_getverticalposition_inline\">getVerticalPosition</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_getverticalposition_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getVerticalPosition</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getVerticalPosition</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.virtualstick</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To get the movement amount of the control stick in the vertical position (verticalPosition). The range is [-660,660]. When the control stick moves vertically to extreme left, the value of verticalPosition is -660. When the control stick moves vertically to extreme right, the value of verticalPosition is 660.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">int</font></code></td><td>The movement amount of the stick in vertical direction.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_sethorizontalposition\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_sethorizontalposition_inline\">setHorizontalPosition</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_sethorizontalposition_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setHorizontalPosition</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setHorizontalPosition</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">position</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.virtualstick</font></td></tr></tbody><